<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Praxair said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Praxair said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer downgraded Praxair Inc to market perform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Thursday at 45-1/2.</p>
